{'symbol': 'FFIV', 'date': '2022-12-15 07:00:00', 'title': 'F5 APPOINTS KARA SPRAGUE AS CHIEF PRODUCT OFFICER', 'text': "SEATTLE--( BUSINESS WIRE )--F5 (NASDAQ: FFIV) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF KARA SPRAGUE TO THE NEWLY CREATED ROLE OF CHIEF PRODUCT OFFICER. IN THIS ROLE, SPRAGUE WILL OVERSEE F5'S ENTIRE PORTFOLIO OF MULTI-CLOUD APPLICATION SECURITY AND DELIVERY SOLUTIONS, WITH A FOCUS ON EXPANDING SAAS OFFERINGS ON THE F5 DISTRIBUTED CLOUD PLATFORM AND ENABLING ORGANIZATIONS TO STREAMLINE APPLICATION SECURITY AND DELIVERY OPERATIONS ACROSS THEIR COMPLEX APPLICATION ENVIRONMENTS."}